$$H_0: \text{Your grade is independent of your course type}$$
$$H_a: \text{Your grade is not independent of your course type}$$

__Question__:  What is the test statistic, $\chi^2$?
__Answer__: 1.7707

__Question__:  How many degrees of freedom does this test have?
__Answer__: 4 

